WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.702
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.136
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.905
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.740
President Biden met yesterday

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:12.211
with Mexican President
Andrés Manuel López Obrador,

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:13.813
where he was surprised to learn

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.748
that that's all one guy.

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:16.516
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.750
[ As Biden ]
Aw, man!

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.019
I thought I was meeting
with four soccer players.

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:21.187
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.622
The White House
announced yesterday

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.156
that President Biden's attorneys

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:26.626
recently discovered
classified documents

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.129
while packing up
the Washington office he used

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:31.064
after serving as vice president,

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.266
in case you're wondering
why Tucker Carlson

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.902
did his show tonight
in full Joker makeup.

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:38.037
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.239
The House yesterday approved
a set of rules

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:43.242
that will weaken
Speaker Kevin McCarthy's powers.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:46.412
Really? How could they possibly
make him any weaker?

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.748
[ Laughter ]
They're already treating him

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:51.818
like a substitute teacher
on the last day of school.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:53.319
[ Laughter ]
Are they going to make him

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.588
wear the "Kick me" sign
on the front?

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.323
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.525
Arizona Senator Kyrsten Sinema
yesterday

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.661
led a bipartisan group
of lawmakers

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.362
on a visit
to the Southern border

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:06.166
because, if there's one thing
Kyrsten Sinema loves,

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.668
it's when a sentence starts
with her name.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.470
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.641
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.012
Republican Representative
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:21.681
tweeted a video of herself
walking in slow motion

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:22.882
through the halls of Congress

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:26.786
to the 1999 Dr. Dre song
"Still D.R.E."

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:27.887
Good God, madam,

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.421
have you no diggity?

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:32.492
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.128
She had to take it down.
True story.

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:37.697
Dre made her take it down.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.032
[ Cheering and applause ]
Cease and desist.

00:01:40.032 --> 00:01:42.168
She made a mistake.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.904
She made a mistake they teach
you first day in law school.

00:01:45.904 --> 00:01:47.106
She Forgot About Dre.

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:50.443
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.580
House Republicans
are reportedly planning

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.048
to launch a panel this week
to investigate

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:58.784
White House communications
with big-tech companies.

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:01.553
Okay, well, we've seen
the latest tech

00:02:01.553 --> 00:02:03.623
and it's definitely Republican.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.592
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:09.562
Disgraced cryptocurrency
executive Sam Bankman-Fried

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.530
has hired a pair
of defense attorneys

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.366
to join his legal team,
who previously worked

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:16.502
on cases involving
drug lord El Chapo

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:19.372
and convicted sex trafficker
Ghislaine Maxwell.

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:22.275
I guess he's hoping
third time's a charm?

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.443
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:26.145
"Good news --
we got the Maxwell guy

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:28.481
and the Chapo guy."

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.684
New York's MTA yesterday
reopened 18 bathrooms

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:35.087
and 9 subway stations,
and then just this morning,

00:02:35.087 --> 00:02:36.822
they very quickly closed

00:02:36.822 --> 00:02:39.424
18 bathrooms
and 9 subway stations.

00:02:39.424 --> 00:02:40.492
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:43.129
How?
It was only like 12 hours!

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.396
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.396 --> 00:02:46.065
And, finally, a man in Arkansas

00:02:46.065 --> 00:02:48.868
was arrested this week
after he allegedly used a hammer

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:52.071
to smash a hole
in the center of a church altar

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.374
and steal 1,500-year-old relics.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:58.645
Not only has bail been posted,
but the movie has been optioned.

00:02:58.645 --> 00:02:59.712
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:02.048
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

